<title>USA: Dean Witter sells unit to Banque Indosuez.</title>
<headline>Dean Witter sells unit to Banque Indosuez.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc said Sunday it has sold its institutional futures business to Banque Indosuez Belgique SA for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>Banque Indosuez plans to combine the unit with its existing global futures operation, Indosuez Carr Futures Inc, the company said.</p>
<p>Laurence Mollner, who was executive vice president and director of Dean Witter's institutional futures business since 1985, is to be president of Indosuez Carr Futures.</p>
<p>The sale is expected to close by mid-June, the company said.</p>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds is the securities business of Dean Witter, Discover Co.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
